 so called sources are feeding you wrong information whether they do it purposely or ignorantly is debatable. \n\nCovid vaccine mandates, vaccine passports, people losing their jobs over a vaccine that doesn’t even prevent you from getting COVID, lockdowns, all was nothing short of tyranny. \n\nIt was the biggest crackdown on personal liberty & freedom I’ve ever seen in my lifetime. \n\nWhat was the motivation behind that? Making a pharmaceutical company tons of money that in return they donate right back to politicians? A test to see how much tyranny they could get away with will simultaneously chipping away more of your freedoms? I suspect a little bit of both. \n\nThe founding fathers of our country fought a revolution to gain their freedom from a tyrannical empire, in return 250 years later we’ve became the biggest government in the history of the world. Not exactly what they envisioned. \n\nThey will slowly, day after day, year after year, chip away more and more of your civil liberties and freedoms. It amazes me just how much they have got away with since 2020 alone, and how many people went along with the narrative without asking any questions. \n\nIt is our duty as Americans to keep the government in check, we must remember that. As small as our voices are, just one idea or one person speaking out can have a domino effect that results in the American people’s voices being heard.', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 0, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Fri Jan 10 02:51:45 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1877347490887811322', 'display_text_range': [14, 292], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '69156861', 'name': 'Chief Nerd', 'screen_name': 'TheChiefNerd', 'indices': [0, 13]}]}, 'favorite_count': 0, 'favorited': False, 'full_text': '@TheChiefNerd The problem is your so called sources are feeding you wrong infor